[{"client_msg_id":"1b1b8076-06af-4ab6-84ed-4b20a7823380","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"WindowsのGoってローカルタイムゾーンを変更するお手軽な手段がないみたい… UNIXならTZを設定するようなの。","ts":"1618901765.275900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d7N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78595a84-8ddf-4e68-a52e-9f3623b2eee9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"iotest だと TimeoutReader なら検出できるかも?","ts":"1618893391.274900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C4OX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bd9df5b-1aeb-4339-9ff7-c1bf97861b26","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"少し具体的な例を言うと、 io.Reader 実装側は 4 の倍数の端数に対しては埋めないで返すような実装になっていて、 io.ReadFull 呼び出し側は 4 の倍数でないサイズのバッファを与えるような場合、どちらが悪いとも言えない (が実際詰まる) というケースです","ts":"1618885885.274500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"89=K"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UR6TTSGK1","text":"\u003c@UR6TTSGK1\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1618881233.273200","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"a87680ee-b0cf-491f-a37e-79d8b378d6f6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"えーっと、理屈上は実装側も仕様に沿ってるし、どちらが悪いとも言えないようなケースです","ts":"1618880945.273000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t+ux1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88a76c66-3c16-4202-a3c4-18ebf549c75a","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"testing/iotestで検出できない系ですか？","ts":"1618875916.272900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bb3vV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd4d0ec8-2b96-4148-be31-8fcbe28159f7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"io.ReadFull、 io.Reader 側の実装がまずいと無限に詰まることがあるな… (中途半端なバッファサイズを受け取ったときは n=0 を返す、みたいな実装になっている場合)","ts":"1618845948.272400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qv7n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f49d5d6-936f-463d-a429-45f283fdad6b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あとで channel にしてみます。ありがとうございます","ts":"1618845121.271300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e51026a6-a97a-4372-b936-4c2fa8427e71","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほ","ts":"1618844855.271000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/904"}]},{"client_msg_id":"874db3c3-b15f-42e6-85ea-ee5e5b68d387","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それに近い設計思想だとtime.Timerもそうだな。","ts":"1618844484.270500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"42j5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1799899-2f12-47c4-b59b-6408f41c7d54","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"準備している間だけactiveなcontext.Contextがあればよいのでは。","ts":"1618844450.270200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OSb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"761b538f-d835-40fe-9f7f-10e6bd9d42eb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"じゃあ \u0026lt;-context.Done() とかでいいかもね。","ts":"1618844423.269700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LZgb"}]}]
